+ android_shell cmd wifi status 
+ android_shell dumpsys wifi 
+ android_shell getprop dhcp.eth0.ipaddress 
NOTE: <unknown ssid>/no Wi-Fi state is expected for Waydroid's veth/Ethernet transport.
+ android_shell dumpsys\ wifi\ \|\ grep\ -i\ multicast 
NOTE: dumpsys can list locks but cannot acquire one. MulticastLock acquisition/receive must be
      exercised by an APK declaring CHANGE_WIFI_MULTICAST_STATE; do not report it as tested here.

